Maintainer: Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: wildos-live
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 wildos-desktop,
 wildos-installer,
 dracut-live,
 isomd5sum,
 x11-xserver-utils,
 passwd,
 sudo,
 kwin-wayland,
 qemu-guest-agent,
Description: Wild OS live session
 Configuration that only belongs on the live ISO: a passwordless live user
 that logs straight into the desktop, and the installer launcher. The
 installer removes this package from the installed system, which also removes
 the live user.
 .
 With wildos.dev=1 on the boot command line, which only the developer
 tools pass, it also starts the QEMU guest agent so they can install
 rebuilt packages into a test machine.
